meta {
  name: 03_RequestAndWithdraw
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: A public sector system user requests a package, sees it as sent and withdraws it

    Given the system user has no pending sent request to the recipient
    When the system user requests the package from the recipient by organisation number
    Then the system user sees the request among its sent requests
    When the system user withdraws the request
    Then the request is withdrawn
    And the request is no longer pending among the system user's sent requests
}
